{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 15 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图神经网络：当边、拓扑和关系本身就是医学信息</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Graph &amp; Mesh Networks</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_132_graphsage-title\">GraphSAGE</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">GraphSAGE 学的是可应用到新节点的聚合器，并用固定邻居采样实现归纳式 mini-batch GNN。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Inductive graph representation learning that samples fixed-size K-hop neighborhoods and applies learnable aggregator functions (mean, LSTM, pooling) to generalize to unseen nodes.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图 G=(V,E)、节点特征和待编码节点批次</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Graph G=(V,E), node attribute features x_v, and mini-batch of target nodes</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">可泛化到未见节点的 node embeddings 或节点预测</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Inductive node embeddings z_v generalizable to newly arriving unseen nodes or whole slides</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2017/hash/5dd9db5e033da9c6fb5ba83c7a7ebea9-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_132_graphsage')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_132_graphsage')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"GraphSAGE original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/cfd45dfaaf29a4fe75b2.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 7 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_132_graphsage', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_132_graphsage\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_132_graphsage')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_132_graphsage', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_132_graphsage\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">节点、边与特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">、 feature</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">可为患者相似图、细胞图或血管网络</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests graph g=(v,e), node attribute features x_v, and mini-batch of target nodes and prepares initial tensor representations (、 feature).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"可为患者相似图、细胞图或血管网络\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests graph g=(v,e), node attribute features x_v, and mini-batch of target nodes and prepares initial tensor representations (、 feature).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"节点、边与特征\" data-node-name-en=\"、 feature\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_132_graphsage', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">节点、边与特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">、 feature</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可为患者相似图、细胞图或血管网络</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests graph g=(v,e), node attribute features x_v, and mini-batch of target nodes and prepares initial tensor representations (、 feature).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每层为批内节点采样固定数量一跳邻居\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Fixed-size neighbor sampler to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Fixed-size neighbor sampler\" data-node-name-en=\"Fixed-size neighbor sampler\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_132_graphsage', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Fixed-size neighbor sampler</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每层为批内节点采样固定数量一跳邻居</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Fixed-size neighbor sampler to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"上一层 embedding 形成局部无序 multiset\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 03 within the core inductive neighbor sampling graphsage computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"邻居表示集合\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 03\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_132_graphsage', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">邻居表示集合</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 03</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">上一层 embedding 形成局部无序 multiset</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 03 within the core inductive neighbor sampling graphsage computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可学习地把邻居集合汇成单一向量\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Mean/LSTM/pooling aggregator within the core inductive neighbor sampling graphsage computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Mean/LSTM/pooling aggregator\" data-node-name-en=\"Mean/LSTM/pooling aggregator\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_132_graphsage', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Mean/LSTM/pooling aggregator</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可学习地把邻居集合汇成单一向量</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Mean/LSTM/pooling aggregator within the core inductive neighbor sampling graphsage computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"拼接自身与邻居向量，线性变换、非线性并归一化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Self-neighbor concat + transform within the core inductive neighbor sampling graphsage computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Self-neighbor concat + transform\" data-node-name-en=\"Self-neighbor concat + transform\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_132_graphsage', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Self-neighbor concat + transform</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">拼接自身与邻居向量，线性变换、非线性并归一化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Self-neighbor concat + transform within the core inductive neighbor sampling graphsage computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"重复采样聚合扩展到 K-hop 邻域\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies K-layer receptive field to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"K-layer receptive field\" data-node-name-en=\"K-layer receptive field\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_132_graphsage', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>K-layer receptive field</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">重复采样聚合扩展到 K-hop 邻域</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies K-layer receptive field to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"接监督 head 或无监督随机游走损失\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces inductive node embeddings z_v generalizable to newly arriving unseen nodes or whole slides via embedding.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"归纳节点 embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"embedding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_132_graphsage', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">归纳节点 embedding</span><span class=\"lang-en\">embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">接监督 head 或无监督随机游走损失</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces inductive node embeddings z_v generalizable to newly arriving unseen nodes or whole slides via embedding.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"GraphSAGE Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 采样邻域聚合的归纳式节点更新</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Fixed-Size Neighborhood Sampling &amp; Concatenated Self-vs-Neighbor Inductive Aggregation</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"GraphSAGE：核心公式 · 采样邻域聚合的归纳式节点更新\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"132\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"17.865756pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.463972 -69.00913 222.847977 17.865756\" width=\"222.847977pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.744351-1.042169L4.61532-1.161274C4.079348-.486346 3.960242-.377166 3.801436-.377166C3.712107-.377166 3.642629-.456569 3.642629-.555824C3.642629-.665003 3.801436-1.280379 3.970168-1.796501C4.267931-2.72949 4.446588-3.463972 4.446588-3.712107C4.446588-4.109124 4.178602-4.37711 3.79151-4.37711C3.146358-4.37711 2.441653-3.731958 1.518589-2.282847L2.70964-6.729435L2.660012-6.779062C2.084338-6.650031 1.697247-6.580553 1.101722-6.511075V-6.362194C1.151349-6.362194 1.210901-6.362194 1.270454-6.362194C1.518589-6.362194 1.766725-6.342343 1.766725-6.123984C1.766725-5.895699 1.607918-5.379578 1.528515-5.081815L.188583 0H.932989C1.330006-1.528515 1.459037-1.865979 1.856053-2.47143C2.372175-3.255538 3.047104-3.870914 3.394494-3.870914C3.543375-3.870914 3.672405-3.751809 3.672405-3.622778C3.672405-3.583077 3.642629-3.454046 3.602927-3.295239L3.057029-1.240677C2.927999-.754332 2.858521-.446644 2.858521-.327539C2.858521-